= Violence

Political violence reaches new heights: state lawmakers are shot, an activist is assassinated at a campus event, and threats against judges and election officials multiply. The temperature is far too high.

- @denounce: Denounce violence from any direction.
- @security: Fund security for officials and election workers.
- @blame: Blame the other side.

@denounce
subtitle: Principled.
on-arrival: stability += 4; media_trust += 2; far_right -= 2; far_left -= 2; enthusiasm -= 1

We say, clearly, that violence is never acceptable.

@security
subtitle: Practical.
on-arrival: stability += 3; funds -= 1 if funds > 0; far_right -= 1

Funds flow to local security.

@blame
subtitle: Cathartic, corrosive.
on-arrival: enthusiasm += 2; stability -= 3; far_right += 2; far_left += 2; media_trust -= 2

Rhetoric escalates. The temperature does not drop.
